  "description": "Provides enterprise-grade logging capabilities for TuanZi applications through log4net integration, including:\n\t\t\t- Comprehensive log4net configuration support\n\t\t\t- Multiple log output targets (file, database, console, etc.)\n\t\t\t- Structured logging capabilities\n\t\t\t- Log filtering and level management\n\t\t\t- Performance-optimized logging pipeline\n\t\t\t- Contextual logging with logical thread contexts\n\t\t\t- Custom appender integration points\n\t\t\t- Seamless integration with TuanZi diagnostic systems",
